---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Rushal Sharma | Marketing × Technology × Creativity"
  description="Bridging the gap between engineering rigor and creative communication. Demand Generation Specialist, building StudioRavya, and event director."
>
  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 lg:py-12">
    
    <!-- Top Context Ribbon -->
    <section class="pb-4 mb-8 border-b border-[#1B1B18]/15">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs font-sans">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white bg-[#1F3A3D] px-2 py-0.5 rounded">
            Dossier / Vol. 04
          </span>
          <span class="text-[#1B1B18]/40">•</span>
          <span class="text-[#1B1B18]/80 font-medium">Rushal Sharma</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-[#1B1B18]/70">
          <span>Udaipur × Hybrid</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>Marketing • Technology • Creativity</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Hero Editorial Frame: Asymmetric Stage -->
    <section class="pb-16 border-b border-[#1B1B18]/15">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start">
        
        <!-- Left Column (7 cols) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-8">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#C1592B]"></span>
              <span class="font-sans text-[12px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#C1592B] font-bold">
                Mandate &amp; Profile
              </span>
            </div>
            <h1 class="font-serif text-[42px] sm:text-[54px] text-[#1B1B18] tracking-tight leading-[1.05] font-normal">
              About
            </h1>
            <p class="font-serif text-[22px] sm:text-[26px] text-[#1B1B18] font-normal pt-1 leading-snug">
              Bridging the gap between engineering rigor and creative communication.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Core Thesis Quote -->
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-[#C1592B] border border-[#E6E1D8] space-y-2 shadow-sm">
            <span class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#1F3A3D] font-bold block">
              Core Thesis
            </span>
            <p class="font-serif text-[18px] text-[#1B1B18] italic leading-relaxed">
              “Most modern silos force a false truce: either you build the system or you craft its voice. I operate on the premise that high-conviction products require one unified nervous system.”
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Key Vital Stats -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3 pt-2">
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded border border-[#E6E1D8]">
              <span class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#1B1B18]/60 block font-semibold">Primary Role</span>
              <span class="font-serif text-[18px] text-[#1B1B18] block mt-0.5 font-normal">Demand Gen</span>
              <span class="font-sans text-[11px] text-[#1F3A3D] font-medium">Scale &amp; Precision</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded border border-[#E6E1D8]">
              <span class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#1B1B18]/60 block font-semibold">Venture</span>
              <span class="font-serif text-[18px] text-[#1B1B18] block mt-0.5 font-normal">StudioRavya</span>
              <span class="font-sans text-[11px] text-[#C1592B] font-medium">Building &amp; Lead</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded border border-[#E6E1D8]">
              <span class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#1B1B18]/60 block font-semibold">National Honor</span>
              <span class="font-serif text-[18px] text-[#1B1B18] block mt-0.5 font-normal">Veer Gatha</span>
              <span class="font-sans text-[11px] text-[#1F3A3D] font-medium">Winner (as Rushal Suthar)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded border border-[#E6E1D8]">
              <span class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#1B1B18]/60 block font-semibold">Ecosystem</span>
              <span class="font-serif text-[18px] text-[#1B1B18] block mt-0.5 font-normal">DevFest ’24</span>
              <span class="font-sans text-[11px] text-[#1F3A3D] font-medium">Operations Lead</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column: Physical Archival Photo Container (5 cols) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col space-y-4">
          <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg border border-[#E6E1D8] shadow-editorial group">
            
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-[#1B1B18]/10 mb-3 text-[11px] font-sans text-[#1B1B18]">
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold text-[#C1592B]">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[15px]">verified_user</span>
                VERIFIED ARCHIVE
              </span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[#1F3A3D] uppercase">ARCHIVE #2024-RS</span>
            </div>

            <div class="relative aspect-square w-full overflow-hidden rounded bg-[#1B1B18] border border-[#1B1B18]/15">
              <img
                src="/images/rushal-portrait.jpg?v=2024"
                alt="Portrait of Rushal Sharma — Marketing × Technology × Creativity"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="pt-3 space-y-2">
              <div>
                <p class="font-sans text-[12px] text-[#C1592B] uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">
                  Rushal Sharma
                </p>
                <span class="font-sans text-[11px] text-[#1F3A3D] block font-medium">Demand Generation &amp; Creative Technologist</span>
              </div>
              <p class="font-sans text-[13px] text-[#1B1B18]/80 leading-relaxed">
                Working at the juncture of code repos, editorial printing layouts, and high-velocity digital marketing frameworks.
              </p>
              <div class="pt-2 border-t border-[#1B1B18]/10 text-[11px] font-sans text-[#1B1B18]/70 space-y-1">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <span class="text-[#1B1B18]/50 uppercase tracking-wider text-[10px] font-semibold">General Name:</span>
                  <span class="font-medium text-[#1B1B18]">Rushal Sharma</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <span class="text-[#1B1B18]/50 uppercase tracking-wider text-[10px] font-semibold">Veer Gatha Record:</span>
                  <span class="font-medium text-[#1F3A3D]">Rushal Suthar</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2.5 bg-white rounded border border-[#E6E1D8] text-[#1B1B18]/80 font-sans text-[12px]">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-[#1F3A3D]">terminal</span>
              <span>Python • React • Markdown</span>
            </span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[#1F3A3D]">24.5854° N, 73.7125° E</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Detailed Personal Narrative Sections -->
    <section class="py-16">
      <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto space-y-12 font-sans">
        
        <!-- Chapter 1: The Intersection -->
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <span class="font-sans text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#C1592B]">
            01 — Background
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-[30px] sm:text-[34px] text-[#1B1B18] font-normal leading-snug">
            How I ended up at the intersection of technology and storytelling
          </h2>
          <div class="text-[16px] text-[#1B1B18]/80 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Most career advice suggests choosing a lane: become an engineer who leaves marketing to the sales team, or become a marketer who treats technology as an external utility. I never found that division natural or honest.
            </p>
            <p>
              When you learn how databases query, how APIs throttle, and how git branches manage complexity, your understanding of communication fundamentally shifts. You stop relying on superficial slogans. You start framing product capabilities with precision, clarity, and genuine empathy for what is physically possible beneath the glass.
            </p>
            <p>
              That instinct for narrative rigor was recognized early at the national level. As a national winner of <strong>Project Veer Gatha</strong>—conducted by the Ministry of Defence and Ministry of Education, Government of India—I was awarded national honors under my official legal record, <strong>Rushal Suthar</strong>, for chronicling the stories of India’s gallantry awardees. While <strong>Rushal Sharma</strong> is the name I carry day-to-day across all professional, creative, and community work, that formative discipline of primary-source research and ethical storytelling directly underpins how I build systems today.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Chapter 2: What I Do -->
        <div class="space-y-4 pt-8 border-t border-[#1B1B18]/15">
          <span class="font-sans text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#C1592B]">
            02 — Operational Practice
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-[30px] sm:text-[34px] text-[#1B1B18] font-normal leading-snug">
            Demand generation and distribution architecture
          </h2>
          <div class="text-[16px] text-[#1B1B18]/80 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              As a Demand Generation Specialist, my focus is constructing sustainable acquisition systems that compound organically over time. I specialize in multi-channel attribution frameworks, conversion funnel optimization, content ecosystems, and high-retention audience mechanics.
            </p>
            <p>
              Rather than chasing short-term viral spikes that vanish overnight, I build defensible distribution channels rooted in query intent, organic search, and genuine community engagement.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Chapter 3: What I Build Outside -->
        <div class="space-y-4 pt-8 border-t border-[#1B1B18]/15">
          <span class="font-sans text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#C1592B]">
            03 — Community &amp; Collectives
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-[30px] sm:text-[34px] text-[#1B1B18] font-normal leading-snug">
            Empowering regional voices and civic assembly
          </h2>
          <div class="text-[16px] text-[#1B1B18]/80 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Alongside building StudioRavya, I invest energy into community initiatives and regional infrastructure. Working as an operational manager with Gazette Collective, I help steward decentralized civic newsrooms that train young writers, university students, and women fellows in slow, investigative reporting.
            </p>
            <p>
              In 2024, I led operations for Google DevFest Udaipur, assembling 850+ developers and 18 technical speakers to prove that Tier-2 cities in Rajasthan can host broadcast-grade technical summits without corporate event agencies.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Key Ventures & Initiatives Gallery -->
        <div class="pt-8 border-t border-[#1B1B18]/15 space-y-6">
          <div>
            <span class="font-sans text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#1F3A3D]">
              Selected Initiatives
            </span>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-[26px] text-[#1B1B18] font-normal pt-1">
              Field Proof &amp; Public Records
            </h3>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
            <!-- Venture 1: DevFest -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-3.5 border border-[#E6E1D8] shadow-sm space-y-3 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-[#C1592B] transition-colors">
              <div class="space-y-2.5">
                <div class="h-32 w-full rounded overflow-hidden relative border border-[#1B1B18]/10 bg-[#1B1B18]">
                  <img
                    src="/assets/images/about-conference.jpg"
                    alt="DevFest conference hall"
                    class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
                    loading="lazy"
                  />
                  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#1B1B18]/70 to-transparent"></div>
                  <span class="absolute bottom-1.5 left-2 text-white font-sans text-[10px] font-medium">Google DevFest ’24</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-serif text-[17px] text-[#1B1B18] font-normal leading-snug">DevFest Udaipur</h4>
                  <p class="font-sans text-xs text-[#1B1B18]/70 leading-relaxed mt-1">
                    Event Manager & Operations Lead for 850+ delegates across Rajasthan.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <a href="/work/google-devfest-udaipur-2024" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-sans text-[11px] text-[#C1592B] font-semibold hover:underline pt-1 border-t border-[#1B1B18]/10">
                <span>View Case Study</span>
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]">arrow_forward</span>
              </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Venture 2: Gazette -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-3.5 border border-[#E6E1D8] shadow-sm space-y-3 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-[#C1592B] transition-colors">
              <div class="space-y-2.5">
                <div class="h-32 w-full rounded overflow-hidden relative border border-[#1B1B18]/10 bg-[#1B1B18]">
                  <img
                    src="/assets/images/about-broadsheet.jpg"
                    alt="Gazette Collective printed broadsheet"
                    class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
                    loading="lazy"
                  />
                  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#1B1B18]/70 to-transparent"></div>
                  <span class="absolute bottom-1.5 left-2 text-white font-sans text-[10px] font-medium">Gazette Collective</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-serif text-[17px] text-[#1B1B18] font-normal leading-snug">The Gazette</h4>
                  <p class="font-sans text-xs text-[#1B1B18]/70 leading-relaxed mt-1">
                    Manager and editor within a decentralized community journalism network.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <a href="/work/gazette-collective" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-sans text-[11px] text-[#C1592B] font-semibold hover:underline pt-1 border-t border-[#1B1B18]/10">
                <span>View Case Study</span>
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]">arrow_forward</span>
              </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Venture 3: Web Systems -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-3.5 border border-[#E6E1D8] shadow-sm space-y-3 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-[#C1592B] transition-colors">
              <div class="space-y-2.5">
                <div class="h-32 w-full rounded overflow-hidden relative border border-[#1B1B18]/10 bg-[#1B1B18]">
                  <img
                    src="/assets/images/web-dev-hero.jpg"
                    alt="Web & digital architecture tools"
                    class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
                    loading="lazy"
                  />
                  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#1B1B18]/70 to-transparent"></div>
                  <span class="absolute bottom-1.5 left-2 text-white font-sans text-[10px] font-medium">Digital Tools</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-serif text-[17px] text-[#1B1B18] font-normal leading-snug">Web &amp; Systems</h4>
                  <p class="font-sans text-xs text-[#1B1B18]/70 leading-relaxed mt-1">
                    Python APIs, reactive frontends, and literate static web architectures.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <a href="/work/web-digital-projects" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-sans text-[11px] text-[#C1592B] font-semibold hover:underline pt-1 border-t border-[#1B1B18]/10">
                <span>View Case Study</span>
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]">arrow_forward</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Chapter 4: How I Work -->
        <div class="space-y-4 pt-8 border-t border-[#1B1B18]/15">
          <span class="font-sans text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#C1592B]">
            04 — Work Values
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-[30px] sm:text-[34px] text-[#1B1B18] font-normal leading-snug">
            Speed, literate craftsmanship, and high agency
          </h2>
          <div class="text-[16px] text-[#1B1B18]/80 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              I respect small, high-density teams who prioritize working software and real customer conversations over endless planning committees. I believe documentation beats verbal confusion under pressure, and that authentic respect for the audience's time is the only lasting marketing advantage.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="pt-4">
            <a
              href="/philosophy"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-sans text-[14px] text-[#C1592B] font-semibold hover:underline"
            >
              <span>Read the full operating philosophy</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">east</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Closing Action Banner -->
        <div class="pt-8 border-t border-[#1B1B18]/15 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div class="space-y-1 text-center sm:text-left">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-[20px] text-[#1B1B18]">Ready to build together?</h4>
            <p class="font-sans text-[13px] text-[#1B1B18]/70">Explore collaborative avenues or view past project proof.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <a
              href="/collaborate"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#C1592B] text-white font-sans text-[13px] font-medium px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity shadow-sm"
            >
              Collaborate
            </a>
            <a
              href="/work"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-white border border-[#1B1B18]/20 text-[#1B1B18] font-sans text-[13px] font-medium px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:border-[#1B1B18] transition-colors"
            >
              See my work
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
